window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>This complete set includes all four books in the Wish Quartet - over 30 hours of magic, romance, forgotten gods, and plot twists! </b></p> <p>Josephina Espinosa woke up on her last day alive knowing three things: </p> <p></p> <ol> <li>This was supposed to be her last job. </li> <li>Magic wasn't real. </li> <li>The Society of Wishes definitely didn't exist. </li> </ol> <p>She was so, so wrong. </p> <p>Now she's the newest member of the very Society she thought was only a legend. Her work is only just beginning. And Jo must earn her place among her new team by helping grant wishes using powerful, destructive magic within her. </p> <p>Jo is used to having a lot on her plate. What she's not used to is following orders - especially when they come from the mysterious and sexy leader of the Society, Snow. </p> <p>When Jo directly ignores Snow's orders to save the life of her best friend, she learns that there's much to the Society she still doesn't understand. Everyone has their secrets.... And none may be deadlier to discover than her own past.</p>"; 
